<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/claim/morphoeval-mirabet-auxin-pin1-meristem-mechanics> a pk:Claim ;
    rdfs:label "Hamant et al. (2008) & Heisler et al. (2010) pressurized SAM shell stress tensor, cortical microtubule alignment, and PIN1-auxin phyllotactic mechanics (Arabidopsis thaliana (shoot apical meristem L1 epidermis & floral primordia))",
        "Hamant et al. (2008) & Heisler et al. (2010) pressurized SAM shell stress tensor, cortical microtubule alignment, and PIN1-auxin phyllotactic mechanics faithfully reproduces Arabidopsis thaliana (shoot apical meristem L1 epidermis & floral primordia) morphology" ;
    dct:conformsTo <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/mirabet-auxin-pin1-meristem-mechanics-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/mirabet-auxin-pin1-meristem-mechanics-2>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/mirabet-auxin-pin1-meristem-mechanics-3> ;
    dct:description "The simulation script(s) 2008-hamant-meristem-microtubule-stress.py implement the cited source model as published and produce forms that match real Arabidopsis thaliana (shoot apical meristem L1 epidermis & floral primordia) specimens and the source authors' figures. A belief under audit, not a fact: its credibility is the weight of evidence (MorphoEval 0.1.0 overall 92.4/100, audit 2026-10-19-auxin-pin1-meristem-mechanics-audit-v2) and the assessments." ;
    dct:subject <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/8871db0/2008-hamant-meristem-microtubule-stress.py> ;
    schema:about "Arabidopsis thaliana (shoot apical meristem L1 epidermis & floral primordia)" ;
    schema:additionalProperty "does_not_claim: Full 3D multi-layered L1/L2/L3 finite-element polyhedral vertex growth with discrete cytokinesis planes",
        "reconstructed_in_script: 168-cell paraboloidal L1 dome coupled Auxin-PIN1-CMT ODE simulator verifying antisymmetric active flux conservation, 84.91% PIN1-CMT co-alignment within +-30 deg (p = 4.46e-41), and 137.06 deg golden-angle phyllotaxis",
        "reconstructed_in_script: Automated segmentation of Toluidine-Blue Arabidopsis SAM histological section (`arabidopsis_sam_meristem_specimen.jpg`, 539 tunica-corpus nuclei, L1 dome contour & saddle crease localization)",
        "reconstructed_in_script: Doubly-curved thin-shell Laplace-Young principal stress solver across all 4 SAM curvature zones + Fokker-Planck CMT nematic order S_CMT(A_sigma) + transverse-isotropic Lockhart cell-wall yielding",
        "reconstructed_in_script: Kirsch circular laser-ablation wound stress redistribution (rim hoop stress doubling 2*sigma_inf), lateral micro-vise compression (dome S_CMT: 0.18 -> 0.81), and 20 ug/mL oryzalin CMT-depolymerization negative control (S_CMT = 0.04, E_par/E_perp = 1.0)",
        "reported_in_source: Hamant et al. (2008) Science 322:1650-1655 pressurized shell principal tensile stress tensor across spherical dome (sigma_theta = sigma_m = PR/2t), cylindrical flank (sigma_theta = 2*sigma_z = PR/t), and negative-Gaussian-curvature primordium boundary saddle crease, driving cortical microtubule (CMT) alignment and anisotropic Lockhart wall yielding",
        "reported_in_source: Heisler et al. (2010) PLoS Biol 8:e1000516 co-alignment between PIN1 auxin efflux carrier polarity and CMT orientation across L1 meristem cells (84.5% within +-30 deg) and synchronous circumferential reorientation following single-cell laser ablation",
        "transfer_boundary: Axisymmetric/saddle thin-shell stress laws and 168-cell paraboloidal L1 dome mapped to longitudinal histological SAM section" ;
    pk:context "script(s): https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/8871db0/2008-hamant-meristem-microtubule-stress.py; output: docs/media/auxin_pin1_meristem_mechanics_comparison.png; organism: Arabidopsis thaliana (shoot apical meristem L1 epidermis & floral primordia); checkpoint commit: https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/commit/8871db0; environment: python 3.14.7, numpy 2.4.2, scipy 1.17.0, matplotlib 3.10.8, Pillow 12.1.1; spec_fingerprint: e6283030cad9fe71483e6b95b0b71d85936ee41d7e76429d3b5bb4c3138dcc69; artifact_sha256: 7b372f64578f0b74dfe802278082fc9d00f3c3bd7eaea040226322c171af0660; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/auxin_pin1_meristem_mechanics/arabidopsis_sam_meristem_specimen.jpg=3a8b54b71f7c780c..., datasets/auxin_pin1_meristem_mechanics/auxin_pin1_meristem_mechanics_reference.json=db56b93840c38568..., datasets/auxin_pin1_meristem_mechanics/paper_citations.bib=f9f54880f2e74e09..., datasets/auxin_pin1_meristem_mechanics/scout_manifest.json=1c17f6d448f3c423...}; supersedes_audit_id: 2026-10-19-auxin-pin1-meristem-mechanics-audit; claim_boundary: [reported_in_source: Hamant et al. (2008) Science 322:1650-1655 pressurized shell principal tensile stress tensor across spherical dome (sigma_theta = sigma_m = PR/2t), cylindrical flank (sigma_theta = 2*sigma_z = PR/t), and negative-Gaussian-curvature primordium boundary saddle crease, driving cortical microtubule (CMT) alignment and anisotropic Lockhart wall yielding | Heisler et al. (2010) PLoS Biol 8:e1000516 co-alignment between PIN1 auxin efflux carrier polarity and CMT orientation across L1 meristem cells (84.5% within +-30 deg) and synchronous circumferential reorientation following single-cell laser ablation; reconstructed_in_script: Doubly-curved thin-shell Laplace-Young principal stress solver across all 4 SAM curvature zones + Fokker-Planck CMT nematic order S_CMT(A_sigma) + transverse-isotropic Lockhart cell-wall yielding | 168-cell paraboloidal L1 dome coupled Auxin-PIN1-CMT ODE simulator verifying antisymmetric active flux conservation, 84.91% PIN1-CMT co-alignment within +-30 deg (p = 4.46e-41), and 137.06 deg golden-angle phyllotaxis | Kirsch circular laser-ablation wound stress redistribution (rim hoop stress doubling 2*sigma_inf), lateral micro-vise compression (dome S_CMT: 0.18 -> 0.81), and 20 ug/mL oryzalin CMT-depolymerization negative control (S_CMT = 0.04, E_par/E_perp = 1.0) | Automated segmentation of Toluidine-Blue Arabidopsis SAM histological section (`arabidopsis_sam_meristem_specimen.jpg`, 539 tunica-corpus nuclei, L1 dome contour & saddle crease localization); transfer_boundary: Axisymmetric/saddle thin-shell stress laws and 168-cell paraboloidal L1 dome mapped to longitudinal histological SAM section; does_not_claim: Full 3D multi-layered L1/L2/L3 finite-element polyhedral vertex growth with discrete cytokinesis planes]" ;
