    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Module and function docstrings map every equation to Hamant et al. (2008) Science Figs. 1-4 & SOM Text S1, Heisler et al. (2010) PLoS Biol Figs. 1-4, Jonsson et al. (2006) PNAS Eqs. 1-4, and the 3 formal Lean 4 theorems in `morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_033_auxin_pin1_meristem_mechanics.lean` (L1-42, L90-189)." ;
